unders and SMBs. Start free — 100 credits, no card.\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"AI marketing automation India,AI outreach agent,GTM for startups,WhatsApp sales automation,AI sales agent SMB India\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://nebulaa.ai\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Nebulaa.ai — Your GTM Team Just Showed Up\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Gravity posts. Pulsar calls. You close.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://nebulaa.ai\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Nebulaa.ai\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_IN\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@nebulaaai\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Nebulaa.ai — AI Marketing &amp; Outreach for Founders\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Two AI agents. Your entire GTM. Automated.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500;1,600&amp;family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Nebulaa\",\"legalName\":\"Noburo Business Services LLP\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai\",\"email\":\"hello@nebulaa.ai\",\"description\":\"Nebulaa is a Chennai-based AI marketing company. It builds two agents — Gravity for marketing and Pulsar for outreach — and runs managed marketing engagements for brands across South India.\",\"foundingDate\":\"2025\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Chennai\",\"addressRegion\":\"Tamil Nadu\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"India\"},\"makesOffer\":[{\"@type\":\"O