ass=\"flex-1 border border-brand-border dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-white rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 font-body text-sm outline-none focus:border-brand-gold transition-colors placeholder:text-brand-muted dark:placeholder:text-white/30\" value=\"\"/><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"your@email.com\" required=\"\" class=\"flex-1 border border-brand-border dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-white rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 font-body text-sm outline-none focus:border-brand-gold transition-colors placeholder:text-brand-muted dark:placeholder:text-white/30\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"submit\" disabled=\"\" class=\"bg-brand-gold text-brand-black font-body font-semibold rounded-xl px-5 py-2.5 text-sm hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all disabled:opacity-60 whitespace-nowrap\">Join free →</button></form><p class=\"font-body text-xs text-brand-muted dark:text-white/30 mt-2\">Unsubscribe anytime.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><a href=\"/blog/gtm-experiment-linkedin-daily-posting-30-days\" class=\"bg-white dark:bg-[#111110] rounded-2xl border border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-card-hover dark:hover:shadow-[0_8px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"h-36 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/20 to-blue-400/5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-4 font-body text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">GTM Experiments</span></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-semibold text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors leading-snug\">GTM Experiment #1: We Posted on LinkedIn Every Day for 30 Days. Here&#x27;s the Data.</h2><p class=\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 line-clamp-2 mb-3\">A Bangalore SaaS founder ran a 30-day LinkedIn experiment using Gravity. Here&#x27;s exactly what happened — the good, the bad, and the unexpected DMs.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 pt-3\"><span class=\"font-body text-xs text-brand-muted-2 dark:text-white/30\">6 min read<!-- --> · <!-- -->March 15, 2026</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">Read →</span></div></div></a><a href=\"/blog/gtm-experiment-cold-calling-100-leads\" class=\"bg-white dark:bg-[#111110] rounded-2xl border border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-card-hover dark:hover:shadow-[0_8px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"h-36 bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500/20 to-orange-400/5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-4 font-body text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">GTM Experiments</span></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-semibold text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors leading-snug\">GTM Experiment #2: We Had Pulsar Call 100 Leads in One Week. 14 Booked Demos.</h2><p class=\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 line-clamp-2 mb-3\">A D2C founder gave Pulsar 100 cold leads from a trade show. One week later: 14 demo calls booked, 3 paying customers. Here&#x27;s the full breakdown.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 pt-3\"><span class=\"font-body text-xs text-brand-muted-2 dark:text-white/30\">7 min read<!-- --> · <!-- -->March 12, 2026</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">Read →</span></div></div></a><a href=\"/blog/saas-founder-40-leads-on-a-flight\" class=\"bg-white dark:bg-[#111110] rounded-2xl border border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-card-hover dark:hover:shadow-[0_8px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"h-36 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-gold/20 to-brand-gold/5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-4 font-body text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">GTM Strategy</span></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-semibold text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors leading-snug\">How a SaaS Founder in Bangalore Got 40 Warm Leads While on a Flight</h2><p class=\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 line-clamp-2 mb-3\">We walked through exactly how Pulsar was set up, what script it used, and how 40 leads were pre-qualified without a single call made by the founder.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 pt-3\"><span class=\"font-body text-xs text-brand-muted-2 dark:text-white/30\">5 min read<!-- --> · <!-- -->March 10, 2026</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">Read →</span></div></div></a><a href=\"/blog/gtm-experiment-whatsapp-vs-email-outreach\" class=\"bg-white dark:bg-[#111110] rounded-2xl border border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-card-hover dark:hover:shadow-[0_8px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"h-36 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-500/20 to-green-400/5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-4 font-body text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">GTM Experiments</span></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-semibold text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors leading-snug\">GTM Experiment #3: WhatsApp vs Email Outreach — We Tested Both for 2 Weeks</h2><p class=\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 line-clamp-2 mb-3\">Same leads, same message, different channel. WhatsApp got 4x the reply rate. Here&#x27;s everything we learned.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 pt-3\"><span class=\"font-body text-xs text-brand-muted-2 dark:text-white/30\">5 min read<!-- --> · <!-- -->March 8, 2026</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">Read →</span></div></div></a><a href=\"/blog/linkedin-strategy-gravity-runs-for-you\" class=\"bg-white dark:bg-[#111110] rounded-2xl border border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-card-hover dark:hover:shadow-[0_8px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"h-36 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-warm-gray to-brand-off-white relative\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-4 font-body text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Marketing Automation</span></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-semibold text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors leading-snug\">The 7-Step LinkedIn Strategy That Gravity Runs For You (That Would Take You 8 Hours/Week)</h2><p class=\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 line-clamp-2 mb-3\">We mapped out the exact content system Gravity uses — from brand voice ingestion to post scheduling — and why it outperforms manual posting every time.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 pt-3\"><span class=\"font-body text-xs text-brand-muted-2 dark:text-white/30\">7 min read<!-- --> · <!-- -->March 5, 2026</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">Read →</span></div></div></a><a href=\"/blog/gtm-experiment-competitor-content-strategy\" class=\"bg-white dark:bg-[#111110] rounded-2xl border border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-card-hover dark:hover:shadow-[0_8px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"h-36 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/20 to-purple-400/5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-4 font-body text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">GTM Experiments</span></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-semibold text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors leading-snug\">GTM Experiment #4: We Copied Our Competitor&#x27;s Content Strategy for 3 Weeks</h2><p class=\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 line-clamp-2 mb-3\">What happens when you systematically replicate a competitor&#x27;s LinkedIn strategy? Surprising results — and one big lesson about brand voice.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 pt-3\"><span class=\"font-body text-xs text-brand-muted-2 dark:text-white/30\">6 min read<!-- --> · <!-- -->March 3, 2026</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">Read →</span></div></div></a><a href=\"/blog/stop-writing-your-own-captions\" class=\"bg-white dark:bg-[#111110] rounded-2xl border border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-card-hover dark:hover:shadow-[0_8px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"h-36 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-off-white to-white relative\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-4 font-body text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Founder Playbook</span></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-semibold text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors leading-snug\">Stop Writing Your Own Captions. Here&#x27;s What to Do Instead.</h2><p class=\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 line-clamp-2 mb-3\">A direct guide for early-stage founders who are spending more time on content than on customers — and how to fix that in under an hour.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 pt-3\"><span class=\"font-body text-xs text-brand-muted-2 dark:text-white/30\">4 min read<!-- --> · <!-- -->February 28, 2026</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">Read →</span></div></div></a><a href=\"/blog/gtm-experiment-founder-story-content\" class=\"bg-white dark:bg-[#111110] rounded-2xl border border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-card-hover dark:hover:shadow-[0_8px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"h-36 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-gold/25 to-brand-gold/5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-4 font-body text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">GTM Experiments</span></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-semibold text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors leading-snug\">GTM Experiment #5: Founder Story Posts vs Product Posts — Which Got More Leads?</h2><p class=\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 line-clamp-2 mb-3\">We split-tested 20 founder story posts against 20 product-feature posts over 6 weeks. The results changed how we think about content forever.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 pt-3\"><span class=\"font-body text-xs text-brand-muted-2 dark:text-white/30\">5 min read<!-- --> · <!-- -->February 25, 2026</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">Read →</span></div></div></a><a href=\"/blog/founder-mistake-hiring-sales-before-product-market-fit\" class=\"bg-white dark:bg-[#111110] rounded-2xl border border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-card-hover dark:hover:shadow-[0_8px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"h-36 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500/20 to-red-400/5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-4 font-body text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Founder Mistakes</span></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-semibold text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors leading-snug\">The Mistake 80% of Founders Make: Hiring Sales Before Product-Market Fit</h2><p class=\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 line-clamp-2 mb-3\">Hiring a sales team before you&#x27;ve found PMF is the fastest way to burn runway and morale. Here&#x27;s what to do instead.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 pt-3\"><span class=\"font-body text-xs text-brand-muted-2 dark:text-white/30\">6 min read<!-- --> · <!-- -->February 20, 2026</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">Read →</span></div></div></a><a href=\"/blog/founder-mistake-inconsistent-social-media\" class=\"bg-white dark:bg-[#111110] rounded-2xl border border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-card-hover dark:hover:shadow-[0_8px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"h-36 bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-500/20 to-pink-400/5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-4 font-body text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Founder Mistakes</span></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-semibold text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors leading-snug\">Why Inconsistent Social Media Is Costing You More Than You Think</h2><p class=\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 line-clamp-2 mb-3\">Posting 3 times one week, nothing for a month — the algorithm punishes this. So do your potential customers. Here&#x27;s the real cost.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 pt-3\"><span class=\"font-body text-xs text-brand-muted-2 dark:text-white/30\">5 min read<!-- --> · <!-- -->February 15, 2026</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">Read →</span></div></div></a><a href=\"/blog/founder-mistake-chasing-every-lead\" class=\"bg-white dark:bg-[#111110] rounded-2xl border border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-card-hover dark:hover:shadow-[0_8px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"h-36 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500/20 to-cyan-400/5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-4 font-body text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Founder Mistakes</span></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-semibold text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors leading-snug\">Stop Chasing Every Lead. Here&#x27;s How to Qualify Fast and Close More.</h2><p class=\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 line-clamp-2 mb-3\">Most early-stage founders spend 40% of their time on leads that will never convert. Here&#x27;s a system to know in 5 minutes if a lead is worth pursuing.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 pt-3\"><span class=\"font-body text-xs text-brand-muted-2 dark:text-white/30\">6 min read<!-- --> · <!-- -->February 10, 2026</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">Read →</span></div></div></a><a href=\"/blog/nebulaa-vs-buffer-scheduling-tools\" class=\"bg-white dark:bg-[#111110] rounded-2xl border border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-card-hover dark:hover:shadow-[0_8px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"h-36 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600/20 to-blue-500/5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-4 font-body text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Comparisons</span></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-semibold text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors leading-snug\">Nebulaa vs Buffer: Why a Scheduling Tool Isn&#x27;t Enough for Growth</h2><p class=\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 line-clamp-2 mb-3\">Buffer schedules posts. Nebulaa creates them, schedules them, and qualifies the leads they generate. Here&#x27;s a full comparison.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 pt-3\"><span class=\"font-body text-xs text-brand-muted-2 dark:text-white/30\">7 min read<!-- --> · <!-- -->February 5, 2026</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">Read →</span></div></div></a><a href=\"/blog/nebulaa-vs-jasper-ai-content\" class=\"bg-white dark:bg-[#111110] rounded-2xl border border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-card-hover dark:hover:shadow-[0_8px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"h-36 bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-500/20 to-violet-400/5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-4 font-body text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Comparisons</span></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-semibold text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors leading-snug\">Nebulaa vs Jasper AI: One Writes for You, One Publishes and Follows Up</h2><p class=\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 line-clamp-2 mb-3\">Jasper is a great content writer. But it doesn&#x27;t post, track rivals, or call your leads. Here&#x27;s how they compare for founder-led GTM.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 pt-3\"><span class=\"font-body text-xs text-brand-muted-2 dark:text-white/30\">6 min read<!-- --> · <!-- -->January 30, 2026</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">Read →</span></div></div></a><a href=\"/blog/nebulaa-vs-clay-lead-enrichment\" class=\"bg-white dark:bg-[#111110] rounded-2xl border border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-card-hover dark:hover:shadow-[0_8px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group block\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"h-36 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/20 to-emerald-400/5 relative\"><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-4 font-body text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Comparisons</span></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-semibold text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors leading-snug\">Nebulaa vs Clay: Two Approaches to AI-Powered Lead Generation</h2><p class=\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 line-clamp-2 mb-3\">Clay enriches and sequences leads. Nebulaa messages them on WhatsApp, qualifies them, and handles the entire conversation. Here&#x27;s when to use each.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-brand-border dark:border-white/8 pt-3\"><span class=\"font-body text-xs text-brand-muted-2 dark:text-white/30\">7 min read<!-- --> · <!-- -->January 25, 2026</span><span class=\"font-body text-xs font-semibold text-brand-gold opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">Read →</span></div></div></a></div></div></main><footer class=\"relative border-t border-rule pt-[60px] pb-[50px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-[50px] lg:gap-[70px]\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-[10px] mb-4\"><div class=\"w-[17px] h-[17px] rounded-full flex-shrink-0\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 34% 32%, #FFD48A 0%, #F5A623 46%, #A4650B 100%)\"></div><span class=\"font-heading text-[17px] font-normal text-ink\">Nebulaa</span></div><div class=\"font-body text-[13px] text-muted leading-[1.7]\">Chennai, India<br/><a href=\"mailto:hello@nebulaa.ai\" class=\"hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">hello@nebulaa.ai</a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-[70px] gap-y-[40px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[11px]\"><span class=\"neb-label  mb-1\">Product</span><a href=\"/product\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Overview</a><a href=\"/product/gravity\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Gr