 on a Flight\\\",\\\"excerpt\\\":\\\"We walked through exactly how Pulsar was set up, what script it used, and how 40 leads were pre-qualified without a single call made by the founder.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"GTM Strategy\\\",\\\"readTime\\\":\\\"5 min read\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"March 10, 2026\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"Nebulaa Team\\\",\\\"headerColor\\\":\\\"from-brand-gold/20 to-brand-gold/5\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"gtm-experiment-whatsapp-vs-email-outreach\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"GTM Experiment #3: WhatsApp vs Email Outreach — We Tested Both for 2 Weeks\\\",\\\"excerpt\\\":\\\"Same leads, same message, different channel. WhatsApp got 4x the reply rate. Here's everything we learned.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"GTM Experiments\\\",\\\"readTime\\\":\\\"5 min read\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"March 8, 2026\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"Nebulaa Team\\\",\\\"headerColor\\\":\\\"from-green-500/20 to-green-400/5\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"linkedin-strategy-gravity-runs-for-you\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"The 7-Step LinkedIn Strategy That Gravity Runs For You (That Would Take You 8 Hours/Week)\\\",\\\"excerpt\\\":\\\"We mapped out the exact content system Gravity uses — from brand voice ingestion to post scheduling — and why it outperforms manual posting every time.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Marketing Automation\\\",\\\"readTime\\\":\\\"7 min read\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"March 5, 2026\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"Nebulaa Team\\\",\\\"headerColor\\\":\\\"from-brand-warm-gray to-brand-off-white\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"gtm-experiment-competitor-content-strategy\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"GTM Experiment #4: We Copied Our Competitor's Content Strategy for 3 Weeks\\\",\\\"excerpt\\\":\\\"What happens when you systematically replicate a competitor's LinkedIn strategy? Surprising results — and one big lesson about brand voice.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"GTM Experiments\\\",\\\"readTime\\\":\\\"6 min read\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"March 3, 2026\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"Nebulaa Team\\\",\\\"headerColor\\\":\\\"from-purple-500/20 to-purple-400/5\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"stop-writing-your-own-captions\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Stop Writing Your Own Captions. Here's What to Do Instead.\\\",\\\"excerpt\\\":\\\"A direct guide for early-stage founders who are spending more time on content than on customers — and how to fix that in under an hour.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Founder Playbook\\\",\\\"readTime\\\":\\\"4 min read\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"February 28, 2026\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"Nebulaa Team\\\",\\\"headerColor\\\":\\\"from-brand-off-white to-white\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"gtm-experiment-founder-story-content\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"GTM Experiment #5: Founder Story Posts vs Product Posts — Which Got More Leads?\\\",\\\"excerpt\\\":\\\"We split-tested 20 founder story posts against 20 product-feature posts over 6 weeks. The results changed how we think about content forever.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"GTM Experiments\\\",\\\"readTime\\\":\\\"5 min read\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"February 25, 2026\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"Nebulaa Team\\\",\\\"headerColor\\\":\\\"from-brand-gold/25 to-brand-gold/5\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"founder-mistake-hiring-sales-before-product-market-fit\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"The Mistake 80% of Founders Make: Hiring Sales Before Product-Market Fit\\\",\\\"excerpt\\\":\\\"Hiring a sales team before you've found PMF is the fastest way to burn runway and morale. Here's what to do instead.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Founder Mistakes\\\",\\\"readTime\\\":\\\"6 min read\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"February 20, 2026\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"Nebulaa Team\\\",\\\"headerColor\\\":\\\"from-red-500/20 to-red-400/5\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"founder-mistake-inconsistent-social-media\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Why Inconsistent Social Media Is Costing You More Than You Think\\\",\\\"excerpt\\\":\\\"Posting 3 times one week, nothing for a month — the algorithm punishes this. So do your potential customers. Here's the real cost.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Founder Mistakes\\\",\\\"readTime\\\":\\\"5 min read\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"February 15, 2026\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"Nebulaa Team\\\",\\\"headerColor\\\":\\\"from-pink-500/20 to-pink-400/5\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"founder-mistake-chasing-every-lead\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Stop Chasing Every Lead. Here's How to Qualify Fast and Close More.\\\",\\\"excerpt\\\":\\\"Most early-stage founders spend 40% of their time on leads that will never convert. Here's a system to know in 5 minutes if a lead is worth pursuing.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Founder Mistakes\\\",\\\"readTime\\\":\\\"6 min read\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"February 10, 2026\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"Nebulaa Team\\\",\\\"headerColor\\\":\\\"from-cyan-500/20 to-cyan-400/5\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"nebulaa-vs-buffer-scheduling-tools\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Nebulaa vs Buffer: Why a Scheduling Tool Isn't Enough for Growth\\\",\\\"excerpt\\\":\\\"Buffer schedules posts. Nebulaa creates them, schedules them, and qualifies the leads they generate. Here's a full comparison.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Comparisons\\\",\\\"readTime\\\":\\\"7 min read\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"February 5, 2026\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"Nebulaa Team\\\",\\\"headerColor\\\":\\\"from-blue-600/20 to-blue-500/5\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"nebulaa-vs-jasper-ai-content\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Nebulaa vs Jasper AI: One Writes for You, One Publishes and Follows Up\\\",\\\"excerpt\\\":\\\"Jasper is a great content writer. But it doesn't post, track rivals, or call your leads. Here's how they compare for founder-led GTM.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Comparisons\\\",\\\"readTime\\\":\\\"6 min read\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"January 30, 2026\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"Nebulaa Team\\\",\\\"headerColor\\\":\\\"from-violet-500/20 to-violet-400/5\\\"},{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"nebulaa-vs-clay-lead-enrichment\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Nebulaa vs Clay: Two Approaches to AI-Powered Lead Generation\\\",\\\"excerpt\\\":\\\"Clay enriches and sequences leads. Nebulaa messages them on WhatsApp, qualifies them, and handles the entire conversation. Here's when to use each.\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Comparisons\\\",\